DECL	{"args":[{"name":"a","sort":{"sort":"track"}},{"name":"r","sort":{"sort":"region"}}],"body":{"heading_since":"a","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"a"},{"var":"r"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}},"contract":"The heading change of road user a since it entered region r: the signed change of the direction its body points (degrees, left positive), accumulated from the observation at which a's footprint last came to overlap r, where it is zero, to the observation, whether or not a still overlaps r. Measured by integrating a's yaw rate (kin.yaw_rate, deg/s, left positive) from the observation at which a's occupancy of r (rel.occupies) last became true, with the step bound, the largest interval between consecutive observations integrated across. It is unknown where that entry is not observed (a occupied r from the start of the recording, or an unknown occupancy could hide the entry), where an interval between consecutive observations since the observation before the entry exceeds the step bound, or where a yaw rate since the entry is missing. Not a stand-in for a turn: it is a magnitude that a caller bounds, and a road user that follows a bend of the way through r accumulates the bend's heading change.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.heading_change_since_entry","kind":"quantity","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"step","unit":"second"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
